{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-07_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-07","title":"注意衛生","storyCode":"2-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"27524dc860e9e814a9cba82d9fb3733fa443e831ee0e0f3331c7aa95597ba26d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"雖然救下了人，但他們被毀掉的家園已經無法復原，眾人心中悵然。\n而為了完成與龍門的約定，一行需要繼續前進。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十九关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，謝謝你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不安全，快離開吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"離開......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們......又能去哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們把這裡當成家......現在，什麼都毀了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們......沒有錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有錯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"自稱感染者救星的整合運動居然會攻擊感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"形象......是不是崩塌了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"但所謂整合運動的滲透，絕對不是自發的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門一定有不少感染者，已經追隨了整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，寧可相信整合運動也不相信羅德島——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島從來不開空頭支票。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動給感染者的，哪怕只是些幻覺，都沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者連幻覺都很難看得到啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是幻覺，大多數感染者也會不顧一切，伸手去抓那虛無縹緲的救命稻草吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"又有誰會選擇相信，從不忍心欺騙別人的小兔子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！你還不能隨便走動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"是有點頭昏......沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動......還會追上來吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚他們的目的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就立刻動身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"很快，我們就能離開貧民區，與龍門近衛局會合了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"該我......感謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙蘭卡"]}]}
